In the result, C.M.A.No.422 of 2021 is partly allowed :
(i) The award amount granted by the Tribunal is reduced from Rs.25,10,000/- to Rs.22,52,000/- and the appellants are directed to pay to the respondents / claimants a total sum of Rs.22,52,000/- with further interest at the rate of 7.5% per annum from the date of petition i.e., 20.12.2013 till the date of realisation and with costs;
(ii) The appellants shall deposit the balance compensation, deducting the amount already deposited, if any, within a period of six weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this order;
(iii) The respondents / claimants will be entitled to 50% each of the total compensation and they will be entitled to withdraw the entire amount along with accrued interest;

